  "cooked": "<p>At height 925051, AntPool mined two blocks. The stale block and header for <code>0000000000000000000199dc74f0c7d25adc618618ee00db80884b347253c264</code> can be found <a href=\"https://github.com/bitcoin-data/stale-blocks/commit/0dd72148e1f3793b18fe9313e1a55bdf3456bc86\">here</a>.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/a2ef2bc68ee6e453f3f19500a3251e1ca13551b7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/a2ef2bc68ee6e453f3f19500a3251e1ca13551b7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/a2ef2bc68ee6e453f3f19500a3251e1ca13551b7_2_689x489.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nfnLQt0dd6YkBmhgEHDYlkni0S3\" width=\"689\" height=\"489\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/a2ef2bc68ee6e453f3f19500a3251e1ca13551b7_2_689x489.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/a2ef2bc68ee6e453f3f19500a3251e1ca13551b7_2_1033x733.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/a2ef2bc68ee6e453f3f19500a3251e1ca13551b7.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2E2F32\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1371\u00d7973 100 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The blocks are fairly similar in size and transaction count. Their header timestamps match.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/1470ce403581885685f96c7c7c4664b104336cbf.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/1470ce403581885685f96c7c7c4664b104336cbf\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/1470ce403581885685f96c7c7c4664b104336cbf_2_690x342.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2UPexaLr7vrArFWlIsqshtLiXo3\" width=\"690\" height=\"342\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/1470ce403581885685f96c7c7c4664b104336cbf_2_690x342.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/1470ce403581885685f96c7c7c4664b104336cbf.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/1470ce403581885685f96c7c7c4664b104336cbf.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2C2E55\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">733\u00d7364 35.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/70a30e4530868f55323f43ba5d9379fee93cb90a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/70a30e4530868f55323f43ba5d9379fee93cb90a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/70a30e4530868f55323f43ba5d9379fee93cb90a.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"g4qOXNLMNwwzlMOe8JSZop6pD1U\" width=\"690\" height=\"482\" data-dominant-color=\"313F24\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1685\u00d71179 62.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Possibly, the templates for the two blocks were generated in different pool regions (e.g. US and EU) and two miners happened to find a valid nonce for them.</p>",
